&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:35pt;padding-right:10pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:35pt;padding-right:10pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-19pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedDetailedScheduleOfProvisionsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
(2) 【主な資産及び負債の内容】連結財務諸表を作成しているため、記載を省略している。　 </jpcrp_cor:ComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) 【その他】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項なし。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfOperationalProceduresForSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
